  "source_caveats": [
    "`phonepereferenceid` is PhonePe's primary transaction ID — use for bank reconciliation.",
    "`bankreferenceno` is the UTR number — matches bank statement credits.",
    "Two sets of date columns exist: mapped (`txn_date`, `settlement_date`) and PhonePe-native (`transactiondate`, `settlementdate`) — prefer mapped columns for consistency.",
    "`paymenttype` and `paymenttype_temp_old` — the `_temp_old` is a legacy column.",
    "`a_*` columns are from an alternate PhonePe data feed — may not always be populated.",
    "GST is split into CGST/SGST for intra-state and IGST for inter-state transactions.",
    "Some financial amount fields are stored as Text; prefer mapped Decimal columns when available or cast explicitly."
  ],
